        {
          "id": "9f79fa74-0b5c-422e-9a49-aadfa903cab5",
          "name": "Show podcast",
          "request": {
            "name": "Show podcast",
            "description": {
              "content": "Get details for a specific podcast\n## Attributes\n- **title**: The podcast title\n- **description**: The podcast description\n- **language**: The podcast language (e.g., \"en\", \"es\")\n- **owner_email**: The podcast owner's email address\n- **owner_name**: The podcast owner's name\n- **status**: The podcast status (ready, importing, failed)\n- **show_type**: The show type (episodic, serial)\n- **thumbnail_url**: URL to the podcast thumbnail image\n- **cover_art_url**: URL to the podcast cover art image\n- **categories**: Array of podcast categories\n- **directories**: Array of podcast directories\n- **migrated_to_url**: URL if podcast has been migrated\n- **migrated**: Boolean indicating if podcast has been migrated\n- **public**: Boolean indicating if podcast is public\n- **ready**: Boolean indicating if podcast is ready\n- **distribution_ready**: Boolean indicating if podcast is ready for distribution\n- **created_at**: ISO 8601 date-time when podcast was created (read-only)\n- **updated_at**: ISO 8601 date-time when podcast was last updated (read-only)\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "podcasts",
                ":id"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "type": "any",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "key": "id",
                  "description": "(Required) Podcast ID"
                }
              ]
            },
            "header": [
